Build the Project Head module:

BACKEND:
ESCALATION SERVICE (/backend/src/services/escalation.service.ts):

Run as a BullMQ cron job every hour:
1. Query all active customers with status != COMPLETED
2. For each customer, find the latest TimelineEvent for the current stage
3. Calculate delay = now - lastEventAt in days
4. If delay > 2 days AND no existing unresolved EscalationLog for this customer+stage:
   - Create EscalationLog
   - Send in-app notification + email to PROJECT_HEAD
   - Notify the assigned team member
5. If delay > 4 days AND no admin notification yet:
   - Update EscalationLog
   - Send notification to ADMIN
6. When stage changes (new TimelineEvent), mark previous EscalationLog as resolved

ENDPOINTS:
