Build the complete notification system:

NOTIFICATION SERVICE (/backend/src/services/notification.service.ts):

async function sendNotification(input: NotificationInput): Promise<void>
where NotificationInput = {
  userId: string,           // recipient
  type: NotificationType,  // enum of all notification types
  title: string,
  message: string,
  entityType?: string,
  entityId?: string,
  channels: ('IN_APP' | 'WHATSAPP' | 'EMAIL')[],
  whatsappData?: { phone: string, templateName: string, variables: string[] },
  emailData?: { to: string, subject: string, html: string }
}

Implementation:
1. Always: create Notification record in DB
2. Always: emit Socket.io event to user's personal room (room = userId):
   socket.to(userId).emit('notification', notificationPayload)
3. If WHATSAPP in channels: call Meta Cloud API with approved template
4. If EMAIL in channels: call SendGrid with template

NOTIFICATION TYPES ENUM (create all of these):
FOLLOW_UP_DUE, CAMPAIGN_STARTED, CAMPAIGN_COMPLETED, NEW_LEAD_ASSIGNED, VISIT_SCHEDULED, VISIT_REMINDER_1HR, CHECKIN_REMINDER, NEW_CUSTOMER_ASSIGNED, CHECKLIST_UPDATED, CHECKLIST_COMPLETE, PAYMENT_DUE, PAYMENT_RECEIVED, INVOICE_SENT, INVOICE_OVERDUE, LOW_STOCK_ALERT, BOM_RECEIVED, DISPATCH_READY, DISPATCHED, INSTALLATION_COMPLETE, TASK_DELAY_2D, TASK_DELAY_4D, PROPOSAL_SENT, PROPOSAL_ACCEPTED, DEALER_CREATED, USER_CREATED, SYSTEM_ALERT

